{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2021-05-11 08:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Allergan Aesthetics to Acquire Soliton, Expanding Body Contouring Portfolio', 'text': 'IRVINE, CALIF. AND HOUSTON, MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALLERGAN AESTHETICS, AN ABBVIE COMPANY (NYSE: ABBV) AND SOLITON (NASDAQ: SOLY) TODAY ANNOUNCED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT UNDER WHICH ALLERGAN AESTHETICS WILL ACQUIRE SOLITON AND RESONICTM, ITS RAPID ACOUSTIC PULSE DEVICE WHICH RECENTLY RECEIVED U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) 510(K) CLEARANCE AND IS A NON-INVASIVE TREATMENT FOR THE SHORT-TERM IMPROVEMENT IN THE APPEARANCE OF CELLULITE.'}{'symbol': 'ACN', 'date': '2021-05-11 20:59:00-04:56', 'title': "Accenture and Shiseido Establish Joint Venture to Accelerate Shiseido's Digital Transformation", 'text': "TOKYO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ACCENTURE AND SHISEIDO ARE ESTABLISHING A JOINT VENTURE TO ACCELERATE SHISEIDO'S DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION."}{'symbol': 'AFL', 'date': '2021-05-11 16:05:00-04:56', 'title': 'Aflac Incorporated Names Takeko Uemoto Senior Vice President; Enterprise Corporate Actuary', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, GA., MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AFLAC INCORPORATED (NYSE: AFL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT TAKEKO UEMOTO HAS BEEN NAMED SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT; ENTERPRISE CORPORATE ACTUARY, REPORTING TO EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER OF AFLAC INCORPORATED MAX K.'}{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2021-05-11 06:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Air Products Reports Fiscal 2021 Second Quarter GAAP EPS# of $2.13 and Adjusted EPS* of $2.08', 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA., MAY\xa010, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- \xa0 Q2 FY21 (COMPARISONS VERSUS PRIOR YEAR): GAAP EPS OF $2.13, DOWN FOUR PERCENT; GAAP NET INCOME OF $477 MILLION, DOWN THREE PERCENT; AND GAAP NET INCOME MARGIN OF 19.1 PERCENT, DOWN 300 BASIS POINTS.'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2021-05-11 00:01:00-04:56', 'title': 'Amazon Publishes Comprehensive Brand Protection Report Demonstrating Progress Toward Driving Counterfeits to Zero', 'text': 'SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMA